    {
      "id": "cantonese_listening-2026-11-26-yue-0003",
      "front": {
        "text": "",
        "speak_cantonese": "\u9ede\u89e3\u4f60\u4eca\u65e5\u5481\u9072\uff1f",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "\u9ede\u89e3\u4f60\u4eca\u65e5\u5481\u9072\uff1f",
        "notes": "D\u00edm g\u00e1ai n\u00e9ih g\u0101m yaht gam ch\u00ech?\n\nWhy are you so late today?\n\n\u9ede\u89e3 is an interrogative adverb meaning \u201cwhy\u201d and introduces the question."
      },
      "presentation": "audio_only",
      "available_at": "2026-11-25T16:00:00Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
        "hard": "1d",
        "good": "2d",
        "easy": "8d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cantonese_listening-2026-11-26-yue-0004",
      "front": {
        "text": "",
        "speak_cantonese": "\u4f62\u7d42\u65bc\u51fa\u8072\u7b54\u6211\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "\u4f62\u7d42\u65bc\u51fa\u8072\u7b54\u6211\u3002",
        "notes": "K\u00e9uih j\u016bng y\u016b ch\u0113ut s\u0113ng daap ng\u00f3h.\n\nHe finally spoke up to answer me.\n\n\u51fa\u8072 is a verb phrase meaning \u201cto speak up/say\u201d and is followed by \u7b54\u6211."
      },
      "presentation": "audio_only",
      "available_at": "2026-11-25T16:00:00Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
