    {
      "id": "cantonese_listening-2026-11-26-yue-0006",
      "front": {
        "text": "",
        "speak_cantonese": "\u5462\u5ea6\u904a\u5ba2\u597d\u591a\uff0c\u884c\u5f97\u597d\u6162\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "\u5462\u5ea6\u904a\u5ba2\u597d\u591a\uff0c\u884c\u5f97\u597d\u6162\u3002",
        "notes": "N\u012b douh y\u00e0uh haak h\u00f3u d\u014d, h\u00e0hng d\u0101k h\u00f3u maahn.\n\nThere are lots of tourists here, and they walk very slowly.\n\n\u904a\u5ba2 is a noun meaning \u201ctourist(s)\u201d and serves as the topic/subject of the clause."
      },
      "presentation": "audio_only",
      "available_at": "2026-11-25T16:00:00Z",
      "scheduler_state": null,
      "schedule_previews": {
        "again": "10m",
