      "front": {
        "text": "",
        "speak_cantonese": "\u4f62\u5514\u98f2\u9152\uff0c\u6de8\u4fc2\u98f2\u8336\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "\u4f62\u5514\u98f2\u9152\uff0c\u6de8\u4fc2\u98f2\u8336\u3002",
        "notes": "K\u00e9uih m\u0300h y\u00e1m j\u00e1u, jingh haih y\u00e1m ch\u00e0h.\n\nHe doesn't drink alcohol; he only drinks tea.\n\n\u9152 is a noun meaning \u201calcohol/wine\u201d and is the object of \u98f2."
      },
      "presentation": "audio_only",
      "available_at": "2026-11-25T16:00:00Z",
